doc_id\\\": \\\"_default:50a3491ae747d5d6:1\\\", \\\"score\\\": 0.870573, \\\"content\\\": \\\"【阅读理解题】题目：A mental health center encourages students to seek help early instead of waiting until stress becomes overwhelming. Counselors explain that timely support can prevent small problems from growing into larger ones.\\\\n\\\\nWhy does the center encourage early help-seeking?\\\\n选项：\\\\nA. To make students dependent on counselors.\\\\nB. To reduce academic requirements.\\\\nC. To prevent stress from worsening.\\\\nD. To replace family support completely.\\\\n答案：C\\\\n解析：The passage clearly says timely support can prevent small problems from becoming larger ones.\\\", \\\"source_file\\\": \\\"seeds/3_question/question.csv\\\", \\\"content_type\\\": \\\"question\\\", \\\"series_code\\\": null, \\\"series_name\\\": null, \\\"module_codes\\\": [], \\\"keywords\\\": [\\\"考研英语题库\\\", \\\"阅读理解题\\\"], \\\"tenant_id\\\": \\\"_default\\\", \\\"visibility\\\": \\\"public\\\", \\\"source_channel\\\": \\\"hybrid\\\"}, {\\\"doc_id\\\": \\\"_default:7bc172cc5496f7af:1\\\", \\\"score\\\": 0.852698, \\\"content\\\": \\\"【计算题】题目：袋中有 2 个红球和 3 个蓝球，不放回地连续摸出 2 个球，恰好都是红球的概率是多少？\\\\n答案：1/10。\\\\n解析：第一次摸到红球概率是 2/5，第二次摸到红球概率是 1/4，连乘得 2/5×1/4=1/10。\\\", \\\"source_file\\\": \\\"seeds/3_question/question.csv\\\", \\\"content_type\\\": \\\"question\\\", \\\"series_code\\\": null, \\\"series_name\\\": null, \\\"module_codes\\\": [], \\\"keywords\\\": [\\\"中学数学提升题库\\\", \\\"计算题\\\"], \\\"tenant_id\\\": \\\"_default\\\", \\\"visibility\\\": \\\"public\\\", \\\"source_channel\\\": \\\"hybrid\\\"}], \\\"graph_entities\\\": [], \\\"retrieved_count\\\": 137, \\\"degraded\\\": false, \\\"degraded_reason\\\": null, \\\"query\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"note\\\": \\\"真实三通道检索（retrieve_three_channel）\\\"}\"}',NULL,'SUCCESS',1059,1,'','mcp-chat-19862676',NULL,'2026-09-19 13:36:26'),(623,'mcp-1789796193971-c630cda0',0,'calculator','{\"a\": 0, \"b\": 0, \"op\": \"add\"}','{\"content_text\": \"{\\\"result\\\": 0.0, \\\"